{"t":"Poison Arrow","s":"poison-arrow-6742b","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Poison_Arrow_05561d.gif","q":5,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Poison Arrow</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Poison Arrow\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Arrow_05561d.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attack\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">23</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hit_chance\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><abbr title=\"Maximum hit chance before any bow/crossbow hit chance modifier.\">Max Hit Chance</abbr></h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">90%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Ammunition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.80 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050528000835&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Arrow_05561d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a poison arrow.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Causes physical damage. When a target is injured by the arrow it will be poisoned for 33 turns (4 seconds per turn). Poison damage starts at 3 HP for 4 turns, followed by 9 turns with 2 HP and 20 turns with 1 HP each, which adds up to 50 HP over a period of 2 minutes and 12 seconds.\n</p>\n<p>\nAn article from Tibianews, published on October 21, 2007, suggested that the attack rate for Poison Arrow is 22. Previously it has been believed that the attack rate is 20.\n</p>\n<p>Can be obtained in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> through the <a href=\"#/quest/minotaur-hell-quest\">Minotaur Hell Quest</a>. Also obtainable in <a href=\"#/quest/dragon-tower-quest\">Dragon Tower Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/poison-daggers-quest\">Poison Daggers Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/dead-archer-quest\">Dead Archer Quest</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before the Summer Update 2017 it was possible to create 7 of these using the Conjure Poisoned Arrow Spell.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfly\">Dawnfly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Venomsniper\">Dworc Venomsniper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\">Exotic Cave Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Giant Spider (Nostalgia)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Muglex%20Clan%20Footman\">Muglex Clan Footman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer%20Servant\">Necromancer Servant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omruc\">Omruc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poacher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll-Trained%20Salamander\">Troll-Trained Salamander</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"tr